The XXXX statement invoicing me for {$2800.00} for interest AFTER the house was fully paid off, I made clear to them I wasn't going to pay this and will not. Again, I can't help to wonder how many people they con with this ploy. 

Lastly, as they were unresponsive to my attempts to communicate, I was forced to file a complaint with the CFPB and hire an attorney. My attorney 's fees totaled {$3700.00} ( invoice attached ) So currently outstanding and owed to me still by BSI : 1 day of default interest ( XX/XX/ ) refund = {$110.00} Foreclosure legal "" referral '' fee = {$1400.00} My attorney 's fees in pursuing this = XXXX Total owed to me by BSI to date = {$5200.00}",,"BSI Financial Holdings, Inc.",CT,06830,,Web,2023-11-10,Closed with explanation,Yes
