( b ) Violations of this subchapter treated as violations of Federal Trade Commission Act ( 1 ) In general For the purpose of the exercise by the Federal Trade Commission of the Commissions functions and powers under the Federal Trade Commission Act [ 15 U.S.C. 41 et seq. ], any violation of any requirement or prohibition imposed under this subchapter with respect to credit repair organizations shall constitute an unfair or deceptive act or practice in commerce in violation of section 5 ( a ) of the Federal Trade Commission Act [ 15 U.S.C. 45 ( a ) ].

